5","page_id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138#rag-flow","content":"필요한 경우"},"621":{"id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138-16","page_id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138#rag-flow","content":"Fine-tune"},"622":{"id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138-17","page_id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138#rag-flow","content":"Evaluation"},"623":{"id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138-18","page_id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138#1-query-classification쿼리-분류","content":"유저 쿼리(질문)가 검색이 필요한지 판단"},"624":{"id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138-19","page_id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138#1-query-classification쿼리-분류","content":"LLM이 자체적으로 처리할 수 있는 쿼리는 검색 없이 응답하는 것이 효율적"},"625":{"id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138-20","page_id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138#1-query-classification쿼리-분류","content":"ex) 단순계산, 설명 요청('GPT 모델 종류는?')"},"626":{"id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138-21","page_id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138#2-chunking청킹","content":"문서를 더 작은 청크로 나누는 것"},"627":{"id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138-22","page_id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138#2-chunking청킹","content":"청킹은 검색 정확도와 LLM의 입력 길이에 영향을 줌"},"628":{"id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138-23","page_id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138#2-chunking청킹","content":"방법"},"629":{"id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138-24","page_id":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/machine-learning/C138#2-chunking청킹","content":"Token-level Chunking(토큰 단위 청킹)"},"630"