)"},"3014":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-11","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"★실무 함수 뜯어보기★"},"3015":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-12","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"IF 함수는 세 개의 인수로 구성되어 있습니다. 각 인수가 의미하는 바는 다음과 같습니다."},"3016":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-13","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"=IF(Logical_test, [Value_if_true], [Value_if_false])"},"3017":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-14","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"=IF(조건, [참값], [거짓값])"},"3018":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-15","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"=IF(조건 판단 결과가, 참이면 이 값을, 아니면 이 값을 보여라)"},"3019":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-16","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"★IF 함수 예시★"},"3020":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-17","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"<u>[예제] 제품의 매출액이 매출 목표액을 달성했는지 확인할 때 IF 함수를 사용합니다.</u>"},"3021":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-18","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"[D3] 셀에 IF 함수를 입력하고 [D6] 셀까지 채우기 핸들을 드래그해 복사합니다. 제품별 매출 목표액 달성 여부를 확인할 수 있습니다."},"3022":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-19","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"=IF(B3>=C3, \"달성\", \"미달\")"},"3023":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-20","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"=IF(B3>=C3,\"달성\", \"미달\")"},"3024":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-21","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"=IF(매출액이 매출 목표액을 달성했다면 (매출 목표액보다 크거나 같다면), \"달성\"을 표시하라, \"미달\"을 표시하라)"},"3025":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-22","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"​"},"3026":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-23","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"② IFS 함수는 다음과 같은 형식의 함수입니다."},"3027":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-24","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"=IFS(Logical_test1, Value_if_true1, [Logical_test2, Value_if_true2], [Logical_test3, Value_if_true3], TRUE,...)"},"3028":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-25","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"★실무 함수 뜯어보기★"},"3029":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-26","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"IFS 함수는 조건과 조건이 맞을 시 표시할 값을 계속 나열할 수 있으므로 여러 가지 조건을 설정하기 편리합니다."},"3030":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-27","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"=IFS(Logical_test1, Value_if_ture1, [Logical_test2, Value_if_ture2], [Logical_test3, Value_if_ture3], TRUE, ...)"},"3031":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-28","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"=IFS(조건1, 조건1의 참값, [조건2, 조건2의 참값], [조건3, 조건3의 참값], 나머지 경우, 그 외의 값)"},"3032":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-29","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"★IFS 함수 예시★"},"3033":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-30","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"<u>[예제] 배송비 정책에 따라 제품 주문 시 주문수량별 배송비를 다르게 설정할 때 IFS 함수를 사용합니다.</u>"},"3034":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-31","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"[C2] 셀에 아래의 IFS 함수를 입력하고 채우기 핸들을 [C5] 셀까지 드래그해 복사합니다. 고객의 주문수량별 배송비를 확인할 수 있습니다."},"3035":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-32","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"=IFS(B2<11, \"5,000원\", B2<51, \"2,500원\", B2<101, \"무료\", TRUE, \"문의\")"},"3036":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-33","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#1-if--ifs-함수","content":"=IFS(주문수량이 11개 미만이면 5,000원, 주문수량이 51개 미만이면 2,500원, 주문수량이 101개 미만이면 무료, TRUE, 그 외 \"문의\")"},"3037":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-34","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#2-vlookup--hlookup-함수","content":"VLOOKUP / HLOOKUP 함수는 엑셀 초보자들이 가장 어려워하는 함수 중 하나입니다. 그러나 가장 널리, 많이 쓰이는 함수이기도 합니다. VLOOKUP 함수는 목록 범위의 첫 번째 열에서 세로 방향으로 데이터를 검색, 원하는 값을 추출하고 HLOOKUP 함수는 목록 범위의 첫 번째 행에서 가로 방향으로 데이터를 검색, 원하는 값을 추출합니다. 복잡하고 어려워 보이지만, 알고 있으면 회사에서 바로 통하는 함수이니 꼭 알아두세요!"},"3038":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-35","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#2-vlookup--hlookup-함수","content":"VLOOKUP / HLOOKUP 함수는 다음과 같은 형식의 함수입니다"},"3039":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-36","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#2-vlookup--hlookup-함수","content":"★실무 함수 뜯어보기★"},"3040":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-37","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#2-vlookup--hlookup-함수","content":"이해를 돕기 위해 아래의 표를 참고해주세요"},"3041":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-38","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#2-vlookup--hlookup-함수","content":"★VLOOKUP함수 예시★"},"3042":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-39","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#2-vlookup--hlookup-함수","content":"<u>[예제] VLOOKUP 함수를 사용해 세로 방향으로 입력된 제품코드에 따른 제조사를 일괄 입력합니다.</u>"},"3043":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-40","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#2-vlookup--hlookup-함수","content":"위의 VLOOKUP 함수를 [E2] 셀에 입력하고 채우기 핸들을 [E16] 셀까지 드래그해 복사합니다."},"3044":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-41","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#2-vlookup--hlookup-함수","content":"제품코드에 맞는 제조사를 표시합니다."},"3045":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-42","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#2-vlookup--hlookup-함수","content":"=VLOOKUP(D2, $G$2:$H$6, 2, 0)"},"3046":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-43","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#2-vlookup--hlookup-함수","content":"=VLOOKUP([D2] 셀의 제품코드를, [G2:H6] 셀의 세로 표 목록에서 검색하여, 표 목록 2열에 위치한 제조사 목록을 가져온다, 정확히 일치해야 한다)"},"3047":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-44","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#2-vlookup--hlookup-함수","content":"★HLOOKUP함수 예시★"},"3048":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-45","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#2-vlookup--hlookup-함수","content":"<u>[예제] HLOOKUP 함수를 사용해 가로 방향으로 입력된 제품코드에 따른 제조사를 일괄 입력합니다.</u>"},"3049":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-46","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#2-vlookup--hlookup-함수","content":"위의 HLOOKUP 함수를 [E2] 셀에 입력하고 채우기 핸들을 [E16] 셀까지 드래그해 복사합니다. 제품코드에 맞는 제조사를 표시합니다"},"3050":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-47","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#2-vlookup--hlookup-함수","content":"=HLOOKUP(D2,$H$2:$L$3, 2, 0)"},"3051":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-48","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#2-vlookup--hlookup-함수","content":"=HLOOKUP([D2] 셀의 제품코드를, [H2:H3] 셀의 가로 표 목록에서 검색하여, 표 목록 2행에 위치한 제조사 목록을 가져온다, 정확히 일치해야 한다)"},"3052":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-49","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#3-sum-sumif--sumifs-함수","content":"**① SUM 함수는 다음과 같은 형식의 함수입니다. **"},"3053":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-50","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","u