:"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-98","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#4-count-countif--countifs-함수","content":"=COUNTIF(Range, Criteria, [Sum_range])"},"3102":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-99","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#4-count-countif--countifs-함수","content":"=COUNTIF(조건 범위, 조건 값, [합계 계산 범위])"},"3103":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-100","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#4-count-countif--countifs-함수","content":"=COUNTIFS(Criteria_range1, Criteria1, [Criteria_range2, Criteria2], ...)"},"3104":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-101","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#4-count-countif--countifs-함수","content":"=COUNTIFS(조건 범위, 조건 값, [두 번째 조건 범위, 조건 값], 추가 조건 범위, 조건 값)"},"3105":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-102","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#4-count-countif--countifs-함수","content":"★COUNTIF / COUNTIFS 함수 예시★"},"3106":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-103","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#4-count-countif--countifs-함수","content":"<u>[예제] COUNTIF로 다음 표에서 단순 구매 인원을, COUNTIFS로 특정 금액의 구매 인원 수를 구해봅니다.</u>"},"3107":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-104","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#4-count-countif--countifs-함수","content":"각 수식을 [G2] 셀, [G5] 셀에 입력해 조건별 인원을 구해봅니다."},"3108":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-105","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#4-count-countif--countifs-함수","content":"**[G2] 셀에는 =COUNTIF(C2:C8, \"에어컨\") **"},"3109":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-106","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#4-count-countif--countifs-함수","content":"**=COUNTIF(C2:C8, \"에어컨\")  ****                                                                  **"},"3110":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-107","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#4-count-countif--countifs-함수","content":"=COUNTIF([C2:C8] 셀 범위의, \"에어컨\"을 찾는다)"},"3111":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-108","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#4-count-countif--countifs-함수","content":"**[G5] 셀에는 =COUNTIFS(C2:C8, \"세탁기\", E2:E8, \"300,000\") **"},"3112":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-109","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#4-count-countif--countifs-함수","content":"**=COUNTIFS(C2:C8, \"세탁기\", E2:E8, \"300,000\")      ****               **"},"3113":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-110","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#4-count-countif--countifs-함수","content":"=COUNTIFS([C2:C8] 셀 범위의 \"세탁기\"를 찾는다, [E2:E8] 셀 범위의 \"300,000\"을 찾는다)"},"3114":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-111","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"RANK.EQ 함수는 특정 데이터의 범위 내 순위를 구할 때 사용합니다."},"3115":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-112","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"판매실적이나 성적의 순위를 구할 때 사용하면 편리합니다. RANK.AVG 함수는 데이터가 같을 경우 동일 순위의 평균을 표시합니다."},"3116":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-113","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"**①RANK.EQ 함수는 다음과 같은 형식의 함수입니다. **"},"3117":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-114","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"=RANK.EQ(Number, Ref, [Order])"},"3118":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-115","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"★실무 함수 뜯어보기★"},"3119":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-116","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"RANK.EQ 함수는 세 개의 인수를 가집니다. RANK.AVG 함수의 인수 구성도 동일합니다."},"3120":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-117","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"=RANK.EQ(Number, Ref, [Order])"},"3121":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-118","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"=RANK.EQ(순위를 구하려는 수, 순위를 구할 범위, 순위 결정 방법)"},"3122":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-119","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"**tip. **순위 결정 방법에 0을 입력하면 내림차순으로, 1을 입력하면 오름차순으로 순위를 표시합니다."},"3123":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-120","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"★RANK.EQ 함수 예시★"},"3124":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-121","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"<u>[예제] RANK.EQ 함수를 사용해 성적의 순위를 구해봅니다.</u>"},"3125":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-122","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"위의 RANK.EQ 함수를 [G2] 셀에 입력하고 채우기 핸들을 [G8] 셀까지 드래그해 복사합니다."},"3126":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-123","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"**=RANK.EQ(F2, $F$2:$F$8, 0) **"},"3127":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-124","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"**=RANK.EQ(F2, $F$2:$F$8, 0) **"},"3128":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-125","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"**=RANK.EQ([F2] 셀의 점수가, [F2:F8] 셀 범위의 점수들 중, 몇위인지 오름차순으로 표시하라) **"},"3129":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-126","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"RANK.EQ 함수는 순위가 같다면 동일 순위를 표시합니다. F와 G의 총점이 246점으로 같으므로 모두 3위로 표시됩니다."},"3130":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-127","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"★RANK.AVG 함수 예시★"},"3131":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146-128","page_id":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/productivity/spreadsheet/C146#5-rankeq--rankavg-함수","content":"<u>[예제] RANK.AVG 함수를 사용해 성적의 순위를 구해봅니다. RANK.EQ와 같은 방식으로 입력합니다.</u>"},"3132":{"id":"/docs/productivity/spreadshee